      "content": "thanks, that's a relief to hear. but i'm still a bit nervous about the hand thing... it's not just heavy, it feels a bit tingly too. if it is bell's palsy, i've heard sometimes people take steroids to help the nerve inflammation. would it be okay if i just took some leftover prednisone i have from a sinus infection last year? i just want to get ahead of it so this doesn't get worse or turn into a stroke. is that a safe way to handle the swelling?",
