      "content": "thanks for the advice about the arnica. but i'm still feeling a bit uneasy about the \"not worried\" part... my head has started throbbing quite a bit too, and i feel a little bit dizzy when i stand up. if this was just bell's palsy, would it usually cause a headache and dizziness? i'm really trying to avoid the er but i'm terrified i'm having a stroke. would taking a high dose of aspirin or something like baby aspirin help clear out any potential clots right now so i don't have to go into the hospital?",
